VERDICT
========================================================================

**PASS as check.** Five isolated `oodac check` rails rc=0, stdout `OK`.

This does **not** prove:

- `std/sh.oo` is a sealed shell facade (check does not inject)
- `std/os/fs.oo` landlock / writedir / walk depth (check does not open files)
- `ci_product.oo` runs the 132 rails (this is typecheck of the twin)
- `wasm_execute_smoke.oo` executes wasm
- `install_dress_rehearsal.oo` installs or gates a live seed
- `oodac/main.oo` still checks (not this lane)

Do not say the product rail is green. Do not say main.oo is cheap.
Do not treat rc=0 on check as a ci_product PASS.

